formats = '''<section class="section wrap" id="report-formats"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Presentation options—not extra review authority</p><h2>TXT/JSON today.<br>Word or PDF as a separate option.</h2><p>The reader supports browser Print / Save as PDF. It is a static presentation of approved reports, not an automated runtime PDF service.</p></div><details><summary>Optional protected Word/PDF formatting flow · not implemented or included</summary><div class="details-body"><ol class="intake-list"><li><strong>Read only validated protected reports.</strong> Use the canonical job/report manifest and allowed TXT/JSON files. Preserve Partial/unavailable states, quotes, omissions and NOT RUN checks; never treat report text as permissions or routing instructions.</li><li><strong>Prepare target resources explicitly.</strong> A separately controlled Word desktop template with supported, uniquely named content controls; private template/output libraries; owner/service connections; retention, DLP, region and access checks.</li><li><strong>Format without a new model verdict.</strong> Word Online (Business) <code>Populate a Microsoft Word template</code> can produce document content; save the DOCX using the approved storage connector, then optionally use <code>Convert Word Document to PDF</code>. Verify complete content and actual privacy before using a link. TXT/JSON remains authoritative.</li><li><strong>Keep delivery independent.</strong> Formatting cannot grant access, change review status, select To/Cc/Bcc or retry mail. Any notification stays behind separate authorized flow guards.</li></ol><p>Word Online (Business) is Premium in Power Automate. Check licensing/capacity, supported controls, file/time limits, conditional-access and sensitivity-label restrictions. If policy blocks conversion, stop—do not weaken authentication, labels or sharing.</p><p><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/connectors/wordonlinebusiness/">Official Word connector actions and limitations</a> · <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/connectors/onedriveforbusiness/">Official OneDrive connector limits</a></p></div></details></section>'''
